{"type":"json_object","message":"The reserve for product warranties was $10 million at Dec. 31, 2006 and $4 million at Dec. 31, 2005 (post_text segment q11). Change = 2006 balance − 2005 balance = 10 − 4 = 6 million (an increase).","tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"10 - 4","variables":{"a":{"value":10,"source":"source:q11n3","unit":"millions"},"b":{"value":4,"source":"source:q11n4","unit":"millions"}},"sources":{"a":"source:q11n3","b":"source:q11n4"}}}